  "description": "Typed kernel for PowerCraft.OCI: a read-only reader of an Oracle Cloud Infrastructure tenancy on the official OCI .NET SDK, mapping compartments, instances, volumes, backups, policies, networks, Cloud Guard problems, agent plugin state, Kubernetes clusters, load balancers, usage and Monitoring metrics into one versioned, deterministic snapshot schema, with a forge for fixtures and a validator for consumers. No field for instance metadata; no mutating operation referenced.",
